{"id":"00245","root":"uni00245_1","name":{"ja":"アスタロト","en":"Astaroth"},"title":{"ja":"【獄炎の女王】","en":"【Queen of Infernal Flames】"},"displayName":{"ja":"【獄炎の女王】 アスタロト","en":"【Queen of Infernal Flames】 Astaroth"},"element":"Devilish","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","roles":[],"traits":[],"release":"2019-09-30","limited":true,"characterId":179,"profile":{"ja":"魔界の一角、マグマが流れる灼熱の大地を領土として君臨する獄炎の女王。強大な力を持ち、自在に超高温の獄炎を放つ。自分を熱くさせる強い者を探し、魔界で様々な強者と戦っていたが、獄炎の女王たる彼女に敵う者はおらず、みな彼女の炎の前に倒れてしまう。何百年も生きており、エドウィン・ブラックとも知っている仲だが、彼とは息が合わず手を貸さない。そのエドウィン・ブラックが何か企んでいるという情報を得てからは、部下であるウェスタをノマドに送り込み情報を流させている。","en":"The queen of the infernal flames who reigns over a scorching realm of magma in a corner of the Demon Realm. She possesses immense power and can freely unleash super-high-temperature infernal flames. She seeks those strong enough to heat her up, and has fought many strong opponents throughout the Demon Realm, but none can match the Infernal Flame Queen; all fall before her fire. Having lived for centuries, she knows Edwin Black and is on familiar terms with him, but their temperaments clash and she refuses to aid him. After learning that Edwin Black is plotting something, she has sent her subordinate Wester to Nomado to leak information."},"illustrator":"ぽ～しょん","voiceActor":"伊東サラ","forms":[{"id":"uni00245_1","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[994,1988],"sp":[150,150],"atk":[138,276],"def":[119,238],"spd":[75,75],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":40,"skills":["2","340001"]},{"id":"uni00245_2","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","levelMax":90,"stats":{"hp":[1488,2976],"sp":[250,250],"atk":[211,422],"def":[173,346],"spd":[75,75],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":40,"skills":["2","340001","340002"]},{"id":"uni00245_3","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","levelMax":100,"stats":{"hp":[1982,3981],"sp":[330,330],"atk":[289,580],"def":[232,463],"spd":[75,75],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":40,"skills":["2","340001","340002","340003"]}],"skills":{"2":{"slot":"attack","id":2,"name":null,"hits":2,"cutin":